		<logic>These data form a network representing the connectivity of the State Routes (SR's) of Washington State. Nodes represent SR endpoints. Also, nodes occur where SR's intersect with other SR's, with county boundaries, and with Washington State Department of Transportation region boundaries.</logic>
		<complete>The data set contains all of the state routes in the State of Washington.</complete>
